step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Councillor Halgrive</col> told me four plague-infected sheep have escaped north of <col=800000>Ardougne</col>, and gave me some <col=800000>Poisoned sheep feed</col>. I should buy a protective suit from <col=800000>Doctor Orbon</col>, herd the sheep into the enclosure with <col=800000>Farmer Brumty</col>'s cattleprod, poison them, and burn their bones in the incinerator.</col>
done	<str>Councillor Halgrive told me four plague-infected sheep have escaped north of Ardougne, and gave me some Poisoned sheep feed.</str>
done	<str>I herded and disposed of all four plagued sheep, and Councillor Halgrive paid me well.</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
